<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>ConsentText</key>
	<dict>
		<key>default</key>
		<string>AdGuard DNS Family protection. Blocks ads, trackers and adult content, and turns on Safe Search.

This profile only changes the DNS resolver used by this device to an encrypted one (DNS over HTTPS / DNS over TLS). It does not install certificates, VPNs, or any management. You can remove it at any time from Settings.</string>
		<key>en</key>
		<string>AdGuard DNS Family protection. Blocks ads, trackers and adult content, and turns on Safe Search.

This profile only changes the DNS resolver used by this device to an encrypted one (DNS over HTTPS / DNS over TLS). It does not install certificates, VPNs, or any management. You can remove it at any time from Settings.</string>
		<key>zh-Hant</key>
		<string>AdGuard DNS 家庭保護版，擋廣告、追蹤器與成人內容，並開啟安全搜尋。

此描述檔只會把裝置使用的 DNS 解析器改成加密連線（DNS over HTTPS / DNS over TLS），不會安裝憑證、VPN 或任何管理設定，隨時可在「設定」中移除。</string>
	</dict>
